<div class='Container'>
  <div class='Introduction'>
    <div class='Introduction__Content'>
      <h1>Hi, I'm Liam - a Front-End & Web Developer based Bristol</h1>
      {% image "./src/assets/images/photo.jpg", "Photograph of Liam Richardson", "Introduction__Image", "100vw", "eager" %}
      <p>
        Thanks to a misguided choice of nickname one summer when I was 12 years old, online I go by
        <strong>Discoliam</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm a front-end developer currently based in Bristol, UK. For <strong>16 years</strong> I've built award-winning
        <strong>Websites</strong>, <strong>Design Systems</strong>, and <strong>Installations</strong> for clients
        around the globe.
      </p>
      <p>I'm the Development Lead at <a href="https://futurekings.co.uk">FutureKings</a>, a creative branding agency working with start-ups and founder-led businesses.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class='RecentProjects' aria-labelledby='recent-projects-title'>

    <div class="RecentProjects__Header">
      <h2 id='recent-projects-title'>Recent projects</h2>
      <a href='/portfolio/' class='Button'>View the Portfolio</a>
    </div>

    {% assign portfolioEntries = collections.all | eleventyNavigation: 'Portfolio' %}
    <ul class='PortfolioNav PortfolioNav--related'>
      {% for entry in portfolioEntries limit: 3 %}
        {% include 'portfolio-card.liquid', entry: entry, headingLevel: 'h3', compact: true %}
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>

  </section>

  <div class='Services'>
    <div class='Services__Grid'>
      <h2 class='Services__Title'>Services</h2>
      <div class='Services__Text'>
        <p class='Lead '>
          As a developer, I like to use technology to help as best I can. I focus on <strong>performance</strong>,
          <strong>accessibility</strong> and the <strong>environmental impact</strong> of digital products. I can help
          you with:
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class='Services__List'>
        <ul class='Lead Heading'>
          <li>UX Design & Digital Strategy</li>
          <li>Technical Planning & Front-End Architecture</li>
          <li>Front-End Web Development</li>
          <li>Performance & Accessibility Consultancy</li>
        </ul>
        <a href='/services/' class='Button'>Find out more about my front-end development services</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3>Previous Clients</h3>
  <ul class='Logo__List'>
    {% for project in portfolio.homepageProjects %}
      <li class='Logo__Item'>
        {% assign svg_name = project | slugify %}
        {% svg svg_name %}
        <span class='sr-only'>{{ project }}</span>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

</div>
